# Local evaluation only. Attribution and upstream terms:
# https://huggingface.co/TheDrummer/Rocinante-X-12B-v1  (card gives no license; base model is Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407)
# https://huggingface.co/bartowski/TheDrummer_Rocinante-X-12B-v1-GGUF
# The card asks for Mistral v3 Tekken without [SYSTEM_PROMPT]: the system text goes inside the first [INST].
FROM hf.co/bartowski/TheDrummer_Rocinante-X-12B-v1-GGUF:Q4_K_M
TEMPLATE """[INST]{{ if .System }}{{ .System }}

{{ end }}{{ .Prompt }}[/INST]{{ .Response }}</s>"""
PARAMETER stop "</s>"
PARAMETER stop "[INST]"
PARAMETER min_p 0.05
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05
LICENSE """TheDrummer/Rocinante-X-12B-v1: license not stated on the model card; resolve before any distribution.
GGUF quantization by bartowski: https://huggingface.co/bartowski/TheDrummer_Rocinante-X-12B-v1-GGUF
Local evaluation copy; no permission for commercial hosting is asserted."""
